      "value": "Addition testing with low movement jumps\n\nIf you are already moving, you maintain some air control, however, if you manage to cancel your speed mid-air, you then lose that air control.\n\nAs your strafe speed is typically lower (I think the default is 2) you can repo this bug in worlds using the default speeds by jumping then trying to strafe even while standing.",
