  "details": "1. Navigate to a world where your movement speed is below ~2.4\n\n(alternatively, navigate to a world with a run speed of 4, then crouch to below 0.65 upright).\n\n2. Jump\n\n3. While in the air, try to start moving\n\nExample world with adjustable RunSpeed (Note, you need to set jump impulse, I used 10 jump) https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_5690dca7-b5bd-4b98-8d37-6606c3867d9d\n\nExample world where you need crouch to hit the bug https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_4cf554b4-430c-4f8f-b53e-1f294eed230b",
